Value Required SYSTEM_ID (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value NEIGHBOR_IP ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value STATE (Up|Down|Init)
Value HOLDTIME (\d+)
Value LEVEL (L1|L2|L1L2)

Start
  ^${SYSTEM_ID}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+\*?${NEIGHBOR_IP}\s+${STATE}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s+${LEVEL}.* -> Record
  ^${SYSTEM_ID}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${STATE}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s+${LEVEL}.* -> Record
